      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Stereoisomers aise compounds hain jin ka structural formula aik hi hota hai magar aik jaise groups space mein alag jagahon par hote hain. Yeh class 12 ke syllabus ka hissa hai aur wahan parhaya jayega."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Stereoisomerism ki do types (qismein) hain:"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": true,
            "items": [
              "Geometrical ya cis-trans isomerism",
              "Optical isomerism"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "table",
            "caption": "Isomerism ki qismein",
            "header": [
              "Type",
              "Farq kis cheez mein",
              "Misal"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "Chain",
                "carbon chain ki shakal",
                "butane / 2-methylpropane"
              ],
              [
                "Position",
                "functional group ki jagah",
                "but-1-ene / but-2-ene"
              ],
              [
                "Functional group",
                "functional group",
                "ethanol / methoxymethane"
              ],
              [
                "Metamerism",
                "functional group ke dono taraf carbons",
                "ethoxyethane / methoxypropane"
              ],
              [
                "Tautomerism",
                "proton ki jagah",
                "amino acid / zwitterion"
              ],
              [
                "Stereoisomerism",
                "space mein tarteeb",
                "cis-trans; optical (class 12)"
              ]
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Summary (khulasa)"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "Structural isomerism: chain (butane / isobutane), position (1- / 2-chloropropane, but-1-ene / but-2-ene), functional group (ethanol / methoxymethane), metamerism (ethoxyethane / methoxypropane, pentan-2-one / pentan-3-one), tautomerism (amino acid / zwitterion).",
              "Stereoisomerism: aik structural formula, space mein alag tarteeb; geometrical (cis-trans) aur optical, class 12 mein."
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
